# 📡 API Architecture Design

This project adopts a **REST API Architecture** as the communication layer between the frontend and backend systems.

The frontend (React) communicates with the backend (Node.js + Express) through API requests and responses.

---

# 🧱 API Flow

```txt id="g5z6o2"
React Frontend
      ↓
REST API Request
      ↓
Node.js + Express Backend
      ↓
SQL Database
```

---

# 📌 API Design Principles

The API architecture follows:

* RESTful API Structure
* Clear Route Naming Convention
* JSON-based Response Format
* CRUD-based Architecture
* Separated Frontend & Backend Structure

---

# 🔐 Authentication APIs

---

## Admin Login

### POST `/api/auth/login`

Used for administrator authentication.

### Request Body

```json id="5d9b0o"
{
  "email": "admin@email.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

---

## Response

```json id="9d1xpw"
{
  "token": "JWT_TOKEN"
}
```

---

# 💉 Service APIs

---

## Get All Services

### GET `/api/services`

Retrieve all aesthetic treatment services.

---

## Get Single Service

### GET `/api/services/:id`

Retrieve detailed information for a specific treatment service.

---

## Create Service

### POST `/api/services`

Create a new treatment service (Admin Only).

---

## Update Service

### PUT `/api/services/:id`

Update treatment service information (Admin Only).

---

## Delete Service

### DELETE `/api/services/:id`

Delete a treatment service (Admin Only).

---

