# ⚠️ Protected Routes

The following routes require administrator authentication:

* POST `/api/services`
* PUT `/api/services/:id`
* DELETE `/api/services/:id`
* GET `/api/bookings`
* GET `/api/enquiries`
* GET `/api/payments`

---

# 🔒 Security Handling

The API system includes:

* JWT Authentication
* Protected Routes
* Basic Validation
* Error Handling
* Secure API Response Structure

---

# 🎯 API Architecture Objective

The objectives of this API architecture are:

* Clear separation between frontend and backend
* Future scalability support
* Improved system maintainability
* Support booking and enquiry workflows
* Establish a modern RESTful API architecture

